# config.json

🟨 json schema for `config.json`

ℹ️ this is an extra unnecessary thing, just for fun or more info

see [config.schema.json](./json/config.schema.json) for schema

validate your config file:

```bash
# install ajv-cli
npm install -g ajv-cli
# download and save the schema in your .near folder then
ajv validate -s config.schema.json -d config.json --spec=draft7
```

---

## Config Field Reference

### Top Level Fields

| Field                         | Description                                                                     |
| ----------------------------- | ------------------------------------------------------------------------------- |
| `max_loaded_contracts`        | Max number of contracts cached in memory (default: 32)                          |
| `genesis_file`                | Path to genesis.json (default: "genesis.json")                                  |
| `genesis_records_file`        | Path to genesis records file (default: null)                                    |
| `validator_key_file`          | Path to validator key file (default: "validator_key.json")                      |
| `node_key_file`               | Path to node key file (default: "node_key.json")                                |
| `tracked_shards_config`       | Which shards to track (RPC default: "AllShards", Validator default: "NoShards") |
| `log_summary_style`           | Log output format: "colored" or "json" (default: "colored")                     |
| `enable_multiline_logging`    | Enable multi-line log formatting (default: false)                               |
| `gc_blocks_limit`             | Garbage collection block limit (default: 2)                                     |
| `gc_fork_clean_step`          | Garbage collection fork clean step (default: 100)                               |
| `gc_num_epochs_to_keep`       | Number of epochs to keep for garbage collection (default: 5)                    |
| `view_client_threads`         | Number of view client threads (default: 4)                                      |
| `state_sync_enabled`          | Enable state sync (default: true)                                               |
| `transaction_pool_size_limit` | Transaction pool size limit (default: 100000000)                                |

### Duration Fields

Duration objects contain `secs` and `nanos` (e.g. `{"secs": 10, "nanos": 0}` = 10 seconds).

| Field                           | Description                                                                 |
| ------------------------------- | --------------------------------------------------------------------------- |
| `log_summary_period`            | Log summary reporting interval (default: `{"secs": 10, "nanos": 0}`)        |
| `state_request_throttle_period` | State request throttle period (default: `{"secs": 30, "nanos": 0}`)         |
| `gc_step_period`                | Garbage collection step period (default: `{"secs": 0, "nanos": 500000000}`) |

### RPC Section (`rpc`)

| Field                               | Description                                         |
| ----------------------------------- | --------------------------------------------------- |
| `addr`                              | RPC server listen address (default: "0.0.0.0:3030") |
| `prometheus_addr`                   | Prometheus metrics address (default: null)          |
| `cors_allowed_origins`              | Allowed CORS origins (default: `["*"]`)             |
| `enable_debug_rpc`                  | Enable debug RPC endpoints (default: false)         |
| `experimental_debug_pages_src_path` | Path to debug pages source (default: null)          |

**`polling_config`**

| Field              | Description                                                           |
| ------------------ | --------------------------------------------------------------------- |
| `polling_interval` | Polling interval (default: `{"secs": 0, "nanos": 200000000}` / 200ms) |
| `polling_timeout`  | Polling timeout (default: `{"secs": 10, "nanos": 0}`)                 |

**`limits_config`**

| Field                   | Description                                      |
| ----------------------- | ------------------------------------------------ |
| `json_payload_max_size` | Max JSON payload size (default: 10485760 / 10MB) |

### Telemetry Section (`telemetry`)

| Field                | Description                                                                        |
| -------------------- | ---------------------------------------------------------------------------------- |
| `endpoints`          | Telemetry reporting endpoints (default: `["https://telemetry.nearone.org/nodes"]`) |
| `reporting_interval` | Telemetry reporting interval (default: `{"secs": 10, "nanos": 0}`)                 |

### Network Section (`network`)

| Field                                   | Description                                                                  |
| --------------------------------------- | ---------------------------------------------------------------------------- |
| `addr`                                  | P2P network listen address (default: "0.0.0.0:24567")                        |
| `boot_nodes`                            | Comma-separated boot nodes format `ed25519:key@ip:port` (default: "")        |
| `whitelist_nodes`                       | Whitelisted nodes (default: "")                                              |
| `max_num_peers`                         | Maximum number of peers (default: 40)                                        |
| `minimum_outbound_peers`                | Minimum outbound peer count (default: 5)                                     |
| `ideal_connections_lo`                  | Ideal connections lower bound (default: 30)                                  |
| `ideal_connections_hi`                  | Ideal connections upper bound (default: 35)                                  |
| `peer_recent_time_window`               | Peer recent time window (default: `{"secs": 600, "nanos": 0}` / 10min)       |
| `safe_set_size`                         | Safe set size for archival nodes (default: 20)                               |
| `archival_peer_connections_lower_bound` | Lower bound for archival peer connections (default: 10)                      |
| `handshake_timeout`                     | Handshake timeout (default: `{"secs": 20, "nanos": 0}`)                      |
| `skip_sync_wait`                        | Skip sync wait on startup (default: false)                                   |
| `ban_window`                            | Ban window (default: `{"secs": 10800, "nanos": 0}` / 3 hours)                |
| `blacklist`                             | Blacklisted peers (default: `[]`)                                            |
| `ttl_account_id_router`                 | TTL for account ID router (default: `{"secs": 3600, "nanos": 0}` / 1 hour)   |
| `peer_stats_period`                     | Peer stats reporting period (default: `{"secs": 5, "nanos": 0}`)             |
| `monitor_peers_max_period`              | Monitor peers max period (default: `{"secs": 60, "nanos": 0}`)               |
| `peer_states_cache_size`                | Peer states cache size (default: 1000)                                       |
| `peer_expiration_duration`              | Peer expiration (default: `{"secs": 604800, "nanos": 0}` / 7 days)           |
| `public_addrs`                          | Public addresses (default: `[]`)                                             |
| `allow_private_ip_in_public_addrs`      | Allow private IPs in public addresses (default: false)                       |
| `trusted_stun_servers`                  | STUN servers for NAT traversal (default: `["stun.l.google.com:19302", ...]`) |

**`network.experimental`**

| Field                             | Description                                  |
| --------------------------------- | -------------------------------------------- |
| `inbound_disabled`                | Disable inbound connections (default: false) |
| `connect_only_to_boot_nodes`      | Only connect to boot nodes (default: false)  |
| `skip_sending_tombstones_seconds` | Skip sending tombstones (default: 0)         |

### Consensus Section (`consensus`)

| Field                                    | Description                                                                          |
| ---------------------------------------- | ------------------------------------------------------------------------------------ |
| `min_num_peers`                          | Minimum peers required for block production (default: 3)                             |
| `block_production_tracking_delay`        | Block production tracking delay (default: `{"secs": 0, "nanos": 100000000}` / 100ms) |
| `min_block_production_delay`             | Min block production delay (default: `{"secs": 0, "nanos": 600000000}` / 600ms)      |
| `max_block_production_delay`             | Max block production delay (default: `{"secs": 1, "nanos": 1800000000}` / 1.8s)      |
| `max_block_wait_delay`                   | Max block wait delay (default: `{"secs": 6, "nanos": 0}`)                            |
| `produce_empty_blocks`                   | Produce empty blocks (default: true)                                                 |
| `block_fetch_horizon`                    | Block fetch horizon (default: 50)                                                    |
| `block_header_fetch_horizon`             | Block header fetch horizon (default: 50)                                             |
| `catchup_step_period`                    | Catchup step period (default: `{"secs": 0, "nanos": 100000000}`)                     |
| `chunk_request_retry_period`             | Chunk request retry period (default: `{"secs": 0, "nanos": 400000000}`)              |
| `header_sync_initial_timeout`            | Header sync initial timeout (default: `{"secs": 10, "nanos": 0}`)                    |
| `header_sync_progress_timeout`           | Header sync progress timeout (default: `{"secs": 2, "nanos": 0}`)                    |
| `header_sync_stall_ban_timeout`          | Header sync stall ban timeout (default: `{"secs": 120, "nanos": 0}`)                 |
| `header_sync_expected_height_per_second` | Expected header sync height per second (default: 10)                                 |
| `sync_check_period`                      | Sync check period (default: `{"secs": 10, "nanos": 0}`)                              |
| `sync_step_period`                       | Sync step period (default: `{"secs": 0, "nanos": 10000000}` / 10ms)                  |
| `doomslug_step_period`                   | Doomslug step period (default: `{"secs": 0, "nanos": 100000000}`)                    |
| `sync_height_threshold`                  | Sync height threshold (default: 1)                                                   |
| `chunk_wait_mult`                        | Chunk wait multiplier (default: `[1, 3]`)                                            |

### Store Section (`store`)

| Field                        | Description                                         |
| ---------------------------- | --------------------------------------------------- |
| `path`                       | Path to RocksDB storage (default: null)             |
| `enable_statistics`          | Enable RocksDB statistics (default: false)          |
| `enable_statistics_export`   | Enable statistics export (default: true)            |
| `max_open_files`             | Max open files (default: 10000)                     |
| `col_state_cache_size`       | Column state cache size (default: 3221225472 / 3GB) |
| `col_flat_state_cache_size`  | Flat state cache size (default: 134217728 / 128MB)  |
| `block_size`                 | Block size (default: 16384)                         |
| `enable_receipt_prefetching` | Enable receipt prefetching (default: true)          |

**`store.trie_cache`**

| Field                                  | Description                                                  |
| -------------------------------------- | ------------------------------------------------------------ |
| `default_max_bytes`                    | Default trie cache max bytes (default: 500000000 / 500MB)    |
| `per_shard_max_bytes`                  | Per-shard cache limits (default: `{"s1.v1": 50000000, ...}`) |
| `shard_cache_deletions_queue_capacity` | Shard cache deletions queue capacity (default: 100000)       |

**`store.view_trie_cache`**

| Field                                  | Description                                                 |
| -------------------------------------- | ----------------------------------------------------------- |
| `default_max_bytes`                    | View trie cache max bytes (default: 50000000 / 50MB)        |
| `per_shard_max_bytes`                  | Per-shard view cache limits (default: `{}`)                 |
| `shard_cache_deletions_queue_capacity` | View shard cache deletions queue capacity (default: 100000) |

**`store.sweat_prefetch_receivers`** - `["token.sweat", "vfinal.token.sweat.testnet"]`

**`store.sweat_prefetch_senders`** - `["oracle.sweat", "sweat_the_oracle.testnet"]`

**`store.claim_sweat_prefetch_config`**

```json
[
	{ "receiver": "claim.sweat", "sender": "token.sweat", "method_name": "record_batch_for_hold" },
	{ "receiver": "claim.sweat", "sender": "", "method_name": "claim" }
]
```

**`store.load_mem_tries_for_shards`** - `[]` (empty array)

**`store.load_mem_tries_for_tracked_shards`** - RPC: `false`, Validator: `true`

**`store.state_snapshot_config`**

| Field                 | Description                                                                                                                |
| --------------------- | -------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------- |
| `state_snapshot_type` | Snapshot type: "Enabled", "GarbageCollect", "ForcedGarbageCollect", "Rollback", "NoSnapshot", or null (default: "Enabled") |

### State Sync Section (`state_sync`)

**`state_sync.sync.ExternalStorage`**

| Field                                    | Description                                         |
| ---------------------------------------- | --------------------------------------------------- |
| `location.GCS.bucket`                    | GCS bucket for state parts (default: "state-parts") |
| `num_concurrent_requests`                | Concurrent requests (default: 25)                   |
| `num_concurrent_requests_during_catchup` | Concurrent requests during catchup (default: 5)     |

### Key Differences: RPC vs Validator

| Field                               | RPC Default | Validator Default |
| ----------------------------------- | ----------- | ----------------- |
| `tracked_shards_config`             | "AllShards" | "NoShards"        |
| `load_mem_tries_for_tracked_shards` | false       | true              |

